    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期您将听到的内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>在快节奏的现代生活中，焦虑如影随形。本期播客我们分享了各自焦虑故事与应对之法。从心理学到普通人的生活感悟，面对焦虑，你并不孤独。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「辣颗药丸 」是一个生活观察闲聊播客，我们尝试做有点意思的自我表达。一般来讲是3个彩色朋友🌈的聊天，偶尔也会邀请嘉宾。 在各大播客音乐平台搜索「辣颗药丸」也可收听，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的邮箱是spicypill@gmail.com，</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎留言，欢迎来信📩。一定会看！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大牛 ，丹丹，李乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:00:42</a> 怎么合理催更？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">00:01:54</a> 最近的一些焦虑时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a>它也是长长短短</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">00:21:05</a> 焦虑到底是个啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">00:41:50</a>“处理”焦虑，可能有这些方法~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">01:04:00</a> 好物推荐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>李乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>英语学习软件：Hello Talk</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvjXWSbGSESVdJ29DK514f8WaFx5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>线下英语角（可以私信问问李乐报名方式）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>丹丹：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>电影《头脑特工队2》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6fBaEWLO-Ln-wYAMM1SH__8aYZ.webp"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>大牛：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>日剧《住宅区的二人》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhLwEVyVKV_KwjE1CL1UHy7uO5Ck.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=2005718421" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=2005718421"><span>Matt Maltese - Irony Would Have It</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《住宅区的二人》同人作品</span></p><span></span><p><span>youtube ：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@erikko" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@erikko"><span>erikko Piano Channel</span></a></p>]]></description>
